{
  "schema": "ti.sounds/1",
  "notes": [
    "The sounds the game plays (game/scripts/audio/sound.gd), by the id its code asks for. Every id is one row of the prompt sheet, tools/sfx/prompts.json: the row named by \"row\", or the id itself. tools/fetch-sfx copies that row's processed takes into game/resources/audio/sfx/ with its entry of the processed manifest, sfx.json, whose gain_db the game applies as the sound's playback gain (tools/sfx/README.md \"Levels\"); a sound with no takes there is silent. The audio itself is never in Git.",
    "Fields: bus (SFX, Ambience or UI: game/resources/audio/bus_layout.tres); space (3d, positional, at the event; 2d, not); loop (a loop the code holds at a level each tick, Sound.hold, rather than a one-shot, Sound.play); voices (at most this many of the sound at once: a new one takes the oldest one's voice); min_gap_s (a request sooner than this after the last one played is dropped); unit_m and max_m (a positional sound is at full gain within unit_m, 6 dB quieter each time the distance doubles past it, and not played past max_m); pitch_jitter (each play's pitch is scaled by up to this share either way) and gain_jitter_db (its gain lowered by up to this). Nothing here raises a sound above its gain_db: the level plan sets it.",
    "Removed by the owner (2026-11-14): coins_jostle, coin_spill and coin_ground, so they are not listed and never copied."
  ],
